<title>USA: CMS Energy to operate plant in Philippines.</title>
<headline>CMS Energy to operate plant in Philippines.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CMS Energy Corp said Monday its independent power unit, CMS Generation Co, acquired a 29.5 percent interest in the Magellan Cogeneration Inc generating plant in Rosario, Cavito, on the Island of Luzon in the Philippines for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The company said CMS Generation negotiated the purchase of a further interest in Magellan such that its ultimate ownership of the facility will be 44 percent.</p>
<p>A unit of CMS generation will manage operation and maintenance of the diesel-fueled plant.</p>
</text>
